--- b4 medium.en: Here is the danger. The letter asks for a full and immediate refund. If the money does not come, the agency plans to withhold part of your monthly benefit. For notices sent on or after April 25, 2025, the default is up to 50%. For Carol, that is about $1,050 held back from each check, and the $9,000 is gone in about nine months. No phone call from Carol is needed to start it. Hold on to that April date. It matters later.
